{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅磡海濱上空晚上有無人機表演賀國慶。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2,026架無人機在半空砌出「77」字樣，祝賀中華人民共和國成立77周年。首位港產航天員暢遊香港的不同地標，表演亦加入國家載人潛水器「蛟龍號」、航空母艦「福建艦」等元素，不少觀眾在紅磡海濱觀賞表演。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DRONE-2300_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DoTIvptKW41790956759.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DRONE-2300_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">匯演歷時約15分鐘，主辦方原定分兩場表演舉行，不過首場表演因雷暴警告生效而取消。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T16:39:31.549620+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}